<p>Hey <%= @user.first_name_or_fallback %>,</p>

<p>Here's the code to confirm a change to your Dabble Me account (<%= @user.email %>):</p>

<p style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 6px; font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;"><%= @code %></p>

<p>It works once, for the next <%= EmailCode::LIFETIME.in_minutes.to_i %> minutes.</p>

<p>
  If you didn't ask for this, someone else may be signed in to your account.
  Reply to this email and we'll help.
</p>

<p>
  <br>
  Thanks,
  <br>
  Dabble Me
</p>
